---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="French Riviera Tips | Accessibility Statement | French Riviera" description="Our commitment to making French Riviera Tips accessible to everyone.">
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:40px;max-width:760px;padding-bottom:40px">
    <nav style="font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);display:flex;gap:8px"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Accessibility</span></nav>
    <h1 style="font-weight:800;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin-top:20px">Accessibility</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--faint);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:20px">
      <p>We want French Riviera Tips to be usable by as many people as possible, regardless of ability or technology.</p>
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Semantic, structured HTML with clear headings and landmarks.</li>
        <li>Sufficient colour contrast and readable type sizes.</li>
        <li>Descriptive alt text on meaningful images.</li>
        <li>Keyboard-navigable menus and links.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>If you encounter an accessibility barrier on this site, please tell us at <a href="mailto:hello@frenchrivieratips.com">hello@frenchrivieratips.com</a> so we can fix it.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
